== SOURCE
l:S_ := { x_ y_ z -> z x_ y_ z }
== TITLE
S, the Starling: one value used twice
== NOTE x_ y_
Two functions
x takes two arguments, y one.
== NOTE z
The value
Given once, used twice.
== NOTE y_ z #2
y z
Right to left, first: y applied to z.
== NOTE z x_ y_ z
x z (y z)
Then x with z on its left and y z on its right. J's hook `(f g) y`, BQN's `F⟜G`, Dyalog's train `(⊢ f g)`.
